Tips
If you use a proxy, add --noproxy '*' to the curl call.

For DR or multiple endpoints, run multiple cron lines with different HOST/PORT.

Feed the CSV into Splunk/ELK/Power BI for trend charts (dns_ms vs connect_ms).

If you want Slack/Teams/email hooks instead of syslog, I can bolt on a minimal notifier, but this version keeps dependencies near-zero and works out of the box.
